      "layout": "media",
      "summary": "A 3D island where each building teaches one area of tech, from CCNA networking to Linux, cloud, Flutter, ASP.NET Core and Kubernetes. I built it to learn the material properly and keep it fresh in my head: lessons lead into quizzes, hands-on labs and spaced-repetition review, and it all runs offline.",
